From: meteowrite <dtodorovtu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:37:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: arm: sunxi: Add PocketBook 624

The PocketBook 624 (Basic Touch) is an e-book reader based on the
Allwinner A13 with a 6" 800x600 e-ink panel, an MStar msg2133 touch
controller and an RTL8188EUS Wi-Fi module.

Signed-off-by: meteowrite <dtodorovtu@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml
index f04db28c630a..aadbc492e963 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/sunxi.yaml
@@ -811,6 +811,11 @@ properties:
           - const: pocketbook,614-plus
           - const: allwinner,sun5i-a13
 
+      - description: PocketBook 624
+        items:
+          - const: pocketbook,624
+          - const: allwinner,sun5i-a13
+
       - description: Point of View Protab2-IPS9
         items:
           - const: pov,protab2-ips9
